              "Explore correlations among speech and biomedical features related to Parkinson's disease.",
              "Build a classification model using K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN) and Weighted KNN.",
              "Use the Elbow Method to determine optimal value of k, and evaluate using Accuracy and Confusion Matrix."
